@startuml
title Authorized report generation
start
:Authenticate requester;
:Validate inclusive date range (start <= end);
:Resolve current group authorization;
if (authorized?) then (yes)
 :Filter canonical records by supported parameters;
 :Aggregate and reconcile totals;
 :Return authorized summary;
else (no)
 :Deny without disclosing records;
endif
stop
@enduml
